  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of squares of the abscissas of all the points on the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> that lie at a unit distance from the line <math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "58",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Any point on the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> can be taken as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>As it is at a unit distance from the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> or <math><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Required sum of the squares&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>58</mn></math></p>",
